🍽️ Omnifood – AI-powered Healthy Meal Subscription

        🚧 This is a demo project for a fictional food-tech company, built by me with guidance from the amazing Jonas Schmedtmann Udemy Course.
        It showcases a modern, responsive, and beautifully designed landing page.

Welcome to the Omnifood project – your intelligent, hassle-free, and delicious food subscription service! Powered by AI 🤖, we deliver customized meals to your doorstep every single day 🏠.
Omnifood is a food-tech company on a mission to revolutionize how busy people eat. Whether you are keto 🥩, vegan 🥦, or kid-friendly 👶, our AI crafts a weekly meal plan tailored to your needs.

🧠 AI-powered meal planning
🍽️ Local, organic ingredients
📦 Freshly cooked & delivered
📱 Flexible subscription & scheduling

✨ Never cook again!
📆 365-day meal service – even on holidays!
🌱 100% local, fresh, and organic ingredients
♻️ Zero waste: reusable containers
⏸️ Pause anytime – get refunds for unused days

🧰 Tech Stack & Tools Used

  1. HTML5 – Semantic structure and content markup
  2. CSS3 – Styling, animations, and responsive layouts
  3. JavaScript (Vanilla JS) – Interactive behavior and DOM manipulation
  4. Flexbox & CSS Grid – Modern layout systems for responsive design
  5. Media Queries – Fully mobile-responsive design  
  6. Progressive Web App (PWA) – Using manifest.webmanifest for installable experience  
  7. Google Fonts – Custom typography with the Rubik font  
  8. Ionicons – Icon library for visual enhancement 
  9. Smooth Scroll Polyfill – Smooth scrolling compatibility 
  10. Form Handling (HTML5) – Basic contact and signup forms  
  11. Netlify-compatible Forms – Ready for form submissions on Netlify hosting  
  12. Git & GitHub – Version control and deployment  
  13. GitHub Pages – Static site hosting
